(text "DIRECTION SENSE. Two separate 12 V opto channels. NOT FOR FABRICATION.\\nUP_RET and DN_RET are different nets. Neither is connected to GND or to each other on this PCB.\\nJoining IN2/IN3 grounds on the previous prototype caused a fault. This sheet does not join them.\\nWhether the boat wiring may tie the two returns together is OPEN. Do that only from the Lofrans diagram, off this PCB.\\nR30 and R40 are OPEN. LED current is (Vfield - Vf) / R. It must stay far below contactor pull-in and inside the Lofrans driver rating.\\nTLP291 pins, KiCad symbol and Toshiba convention: 1 anode, 2 cathode, 3 emitter, 4 collector.\\nLED on pulls the GPIO low, matching the existing firmware (LOW = active)." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "0b7dafd8-d600-45a1-9882-b8789ed7299c"))
