(global_label "DN_RET" (shape passive) (at 69.85 163.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "87dcaf7f-c976-43a3-a507-86fbd65cd46e"))
(text "Current path, each channel, and only that channel:\\nFIELD pin -> R_OPEN -> TLP291 anode, cathode -> that channel RET pin.\\n1N4148 is anti-parallel across the LED (cathode at anode, anode at cathode) so a reverse transient does not break the LED.\\n100 nF is across the LED. Time constant is R_OPEN * 100 nF and is therefore OPEN. Firmware already debounces 30 ms.\\nNo copper path exists from these field pins to GND, to the other channel, or back out as a voltage source.\\nThe opto output cannot push 12 V into the ESP32. The ESP32 cannot push 3.3 V into the Lofrans wire." (at 20 90 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "9ac7607f-a16b-4a94-ab15-f2b0c2773507"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
